WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.020
So, this is Pluto.

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:05.360
You can just have your meeting, and it takes the notes for you.

3
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.340
If you've spoken to someone before, Pluto can recognize their voice automatically.

4
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.400
You can check the names here.

5
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.980
And if you want to see exactly what someone said, just open the transcript.

6
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:26.080
Meetings about the same project stay together, so you don't have to piece everything together yourself.

7
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.980
These are the things you need to do.

8
00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.680
Just tick them off when you're done.

9
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:36.740
Or you can ask a question, like, "What am I waiting on?"

10
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.500
It gives you an answer, and shows you the meetings it came from.
